{"route":"/docs/4.6/utilities/stretched-link/","version":"4.6","renderedVersion":"4.6","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Stretched link","level":1},"lead":{"id":"page--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v4.6.2/site/content/docs/4.6/utilities/stretched-link.md\">View on GitHub</a>"},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Make any HTML element or Bootstrap component clickable by “stretching” a nested link via CSS."},{"id":"content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>.stretched-link</code> to a link to make its <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Containing_block\">containing block</a> clickable via a <code>::after</code> pseudo element. In most cases, this means that an element with <code>position: relative;</code> that contains a link with the <code>.stretched-link</code> class is clickable. Please note given <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/CSS21/visuren.html#propdef-position\">how CSS <code>position</code> works</a>, <code>.stretched-link</code> cannot be mixed with most table elements."},{"id":"content--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Cards have <code>position: relative</code> by default in Bootstrap, so in this case you can safely add the <code>.stretched-link</code> class to a link in the card without any other HTML changes."},{"id":"content--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Multiple links and tap targets are not recommended with stretched links. However, some <code>position</code> and <code>z-index</code> styles can help should this be required."},{"id":"content--example-1","type":"demo","key":"6fb3c425e73b660d8ec5","height":300},{"id":"content--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"card\" style=\"width: 18rem;\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"card-img-top\" alt=\"...\">\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <h5 class=\"card-title\">Card with stretched link</h5>\n    <p class=\"card-text\">Some quick example text to build on the card title and make up the bulk of the card's content.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary stretched-link\">Go somewhere</a>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"content--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Media objects do not have <code>position: relative</code> by default, so we need to add the <code>.position-relative</code> here to prevent the link from stretching outside the media object."},{"id":"content--example-2","type":"demo","key":"5f3470bc3a797b16d03b","height":147},{"id":"content--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"media position-relative\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"mr-3\" alt=\"...\">\n  <div class=\"media-body\">\n    <h5 class=\"mt-0\">Media with stretched link</h5>\n    <p>This is some placeholder content for the media object. It is intended to mimic what some real-world content would look like, and we're using it here to give the component a bit of body and size.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"stretched-link\">Go somewhere</a>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"content--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"Columns are <code>position: relative</code> by default, so clickable columns only require the <code>.stretched-link</code> class on a link. However, stretching a link over an entire <code>.row</code> requires <code>.position-static</code> on the column and <code>.position-relative</code> on the row."},{"id":"content--example-3","type":"demo","key":"d915b1744a89c7452009","height":147},{"id":"content--code-3","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"row no-gutters bg-light position-relative\">\n  <div class=\"col-md-6 mb-md-0 p-md-4\">\n    <img src=\"...\" class=\"w-100\" alt=\"...\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-md-6 position-static p-4 pl-md-0\">\n    <h5 class=\"mt-0\">Columns with stretched link</h5>\n    <p>Another instance of placeholder content for this other custom component. It is intended to mimic what some real-world content would look like, and we're using it here to give the component a bit of body and size.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"stretched-link\">Go somewhere</a>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"identifying-the-containing-block","type":"heading","en":"Identifying the containing block","level":2},{"id":"identifying-the-containing-block--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"If the stretched link doesn’t seem to work, the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Containing_block#Identifying_the_containing_block\">containing block</a> will probably be the cause. The following CSS properties will make an element the containing block:"},{"id":"identifying-the-containing-block--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"identifying-the-containing-block--item-1","type":"item","en":"A <code>position</code> value other than <code>static</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"identifying-the-containing-block--item-2","type":"item","en":"A <code>transform</code> or <code>perspective</code> value other than <code>none</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"identifying-the-containing-block--item-3","type":"item","en":"A <code>will-change</code> value of <code>transform</code> or <code>perspective</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"identifying-the-containing-block--item-4","type":"item","en":"A <code>filter</code> value other than <code>none</code> or a <code>will-change</code> value of <code>filter</code> (only works on Firefox)"}]}]},{"id":"identifying-the-containing-block--example-1","type":"demo","key":"50c0c4f580c0154d3cb6","height":300},{"id":"identifying-the-containing-block--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"card\" style=\"width: 18rem;\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"card-img-top\" alt=\"...\">\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <h5 class=\"card-title\">Card with stretched links</h5>\n    <p class=\"card-text\">Some quick example text to build on the card title and make up the bulk of the card's content.</p>\n    <p class=\"card-text\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"stretched-link text-danger\" style=\"position: relative;\">Stretched link will not work here, because <code>position: relative</code> is added to the link</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"card-text bg-light\" style=\"transform: rotate(0);\">\n      This <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-warning stretched-link\">stretched link</a> will only be spread over the <code>p</code>-tag, because a transform is applied to it.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"}],"demos":[{"key":"6fb3c425e73b660d8ec5","html":"\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"width: 18rem;\">\n  <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img card-img-top\" width=\"100%\" height=\"180\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Card image cap:  \" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\"><title>Card image cap</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\"> </text></svg>\n\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <h5 class=\"card-title\">Card with stretched link</h5>\n    <p class=\"card-text\">Some quick example text to build on the card title and make up the bulk of the card's content.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary stretched-link\">Go somewhere</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"5f3470bc3a797b16d03b","html":"\n<div class=\"media position-relative\">\n  <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img mr-3\" width=\"144\" height=\"144\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Generic placeholder image:  \" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\"><title>Generic placeholder image</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\"> </text></svg>\n\n  <div class=\"media-body\">\n    <h5 class=\"mt-0\">Media with stretched link</h5>\n    <p>This is some placeholder content for the media object. It is intended to mimic what some real-world content would look like, and we're using it here to give the component a bit of body and size.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"stretched-link\">Go somewhere</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"d915b1744a89c7452009","html":"\n<div class=\"row no-gutters bg-light position-relative\">\n  <div class=\"col-md-6 mb-md-0 p-md-4\">\n    <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img w-100\" width=\"100%\" height=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Generic placeholder image:  \" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\"><title>Generic placeholder image</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\"> </text></svg>\n\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-md-6 position-static p-4 pl-md-0\">\n    <h5 class=\"mt-0\">Columns with stretched link</h5>\n    <p>Another instance of placeholder content for this other custom component. It is intended to mimic what some real-world content would look like, and we're using it here to give the component a bit of body and size.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"stretched-link\">Go somewhere</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"50c0c4f580c0154d3cb6","html":"\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"width: 18rem;\">\n  <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img card-img-top\" width=\"100%\" height=\"180\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Card image cap:  \" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\"><title>Card image cap</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\"> </text></svg>\n\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <h5 class=\"card-title\">Card with stretched links</h5>\n    <p class=\"card-text\">Some quick example text to build on the card title and make up the bulk of the card's content.</p>\n    <p class=\"card-text\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"stretched-link text-danger\" style=\"position: relative;\">Stretched link will not work here, because <code>position: relative</code> is added to the link</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"card-text bg-light\" style=\"transform: rotate(0);\">\n      This <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-warning stretched-link\">stretched link</a> will only be spread over the <code>p</code>-tag, because a transform is applied to it.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Content","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/alerts/"},{"en":"Utilities","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/borders/"},{"en":"Borders","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/borders/"},{"en":"Clearfix","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/clearfix/"},{"en":"Close icon","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/close-icon/"},{"en":"Colors","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/colors/"},{"en":"Display","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/display/"},{"en":"Embed","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/embed/"},{"en":"Flex","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/flex/"},{"en":"Float","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/float/"},{"en":"Image replacement","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/image-replacement/"},{"en":"Interactions","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/interactions/"},{"en":"Overflow","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/overflow/"},{"en":"Position","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/position/"},{"en":"Screen readers","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/screen-readers/"},{"en":"Shadows","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/shadows/"},{"en":"Sizing","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/sizing/"},{"en":"Spacing","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/spacing/"},{"en":"Stretched link","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/stretched-link/"},{"en":"Text","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/text/"},{"en":"Vertical align","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/vertical-align/"},{"en":"Visibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/visibility/"},{"en":"Extend","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/extend/approach/"},{"en":"Migration","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/migration/"},{"en":"About","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/overview/"},{"en":"End of Life","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/end-of-life/"}],"standalone":false,"publishedAssets":[{"url":"/docs/4.6/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css","integrity":"sha384-xOolHFLEh07PJGoPkLv1IbcEPTNtaed2xpHsD9ESMhqIYd0nLMwNLD69Npy4HI+N"},{"url":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jquery@3.5.1/dist/jquery.slim.min.js","integrity":"sha384-DfXdz2htPH0lsSSs5nCTpuj/zy4C+OGpamoFVy38MVBnE+IbbVYUew+OrCXaRkfj"},{"url":"/docs/4.6/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js","integrity":"sha384-Fy6S3B9q64WdZWQUiU+q4/2Lc9npb8tCaSX9FK7E8HnRr0Jz8D6OP9dO5Vg3Q9ct"}],"sourceScripts":["https://cdn.usefathom.com/script.js","https://www.google-analytics.com/analytics.js","https://cdn.carbonads.com/carbon.js?serve=CKYIKKJL&placement=getbootstrapcom&format=responsive","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jquery@3.5.1/dist/jquery.slim.min.js","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/docsearch.js@2/dist/cdn/docsearch.min.js","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/js/docs.min.js"],"sourceStyles":["https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/docsearch.js@2/dist/cdn/docsearch.min.css","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/css/docs.css"]}
